      "title": "Andrew Griffith and Tom Tugendhat join Badenoch’s top team in Tory reshuffle",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/aug/31/kemi-badenoch-reshuffle-shadow-cabinet-patel-cleverly-resignations",
      "description": "<p>Conservative leader sacks shadow chancellor Mel Stride and shadow foreign secretary Priti Patel</p><p>Kemi Badenoch sacked her shadow chancellor, Mel Stride, and shadow foreign secretary, Priti Patel, in a sweeping Conservative reshuffle on Monday, replacing Stride with Andrew Griffith, and Patel with Tom Tugendhat.</p><p>Stride, who had been shadow chancellor since Badenoch became leader, was widely seen among Tories as failing to make an impression at a time when Labour had been under pressure over the economy.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/aug/31/kemi-badenoch-reshuffle-shadow-cabinet-patel-cleverly-resignations\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
